"[{\"AllowMultiple\":false,\"EndLine\":46,\"ReplacementContent\":\"## 3. Feature Addition: My AI Workshop Page\\n\\nWe added the new **My AI Workshop** page at `#/ai-workshop` to showcase Gokul's generative UI and adaptive layouts:\\n*   **Header Link ([index.html](file:///c:/Users/ASUS/Desktop/new%20portfolio/index.html))**: Added the \\\"AI Workshop\\\" menu option in the navigation header list.\\n*   **Routing ([router.js](file:///c:/Users/ASUS/Desktop/new%20portfolio/router.js))**: Configured route details and mapped the path `/ai-workshop` to load `renderAIWorkshop` and navigation focus state.\\n*   **Layout & Playground ([views.js](file:///c:/Users/ASUS/Desktop/new%20portfolio/views.js))**:\\n    *   **Experiment 1: Generative UI Layout Compiler**: Features a code terminal window and output canvas. Clicking tabs (Analytics Chart, Bento Grid, Navbar Dock) streams mock compiler bash logs line-by-line in code-colored terminal lines before compiling and scaling the SVG output into the preview canvas.\\n    *   **Experiment 2: Adaptive Contextual AI Helper**: An interactive portal performance card displaying funnel metrics. A pulsing alert dot warns of funnel friction; clicking it opens a glassmorphic diagnostic card. Users can click \\\"Optimize UI\\\" to dynamically apply the design optimization and mark the metric resolved.\\n*   **Styles ([index.css](file:///c:/Users/ASUS/Desktop/new%20portfolio/index.css))**: Implemented styling rules for `.terminal-window` mockups, `.workshop-tooltip` glassmorphism, and `.pulsing-glow-dot` keyframes.\\n\\n---\\n\",\"StartLine\":35,\"TargetContent\":\"## 3. Feature Addition: My AI Workshop Page\\n\\nWe added the new **My AI Workshop** page at `#/ai-workshop` to showcase Gokul's generative UI and adaptive layouts:\\n*   **Header Link ([index.html](file:///c:/Users/ASUS/Desktop/new%20portfolio/index.html))**: Added the \\\"AI Workshop\\\" menu option in the navigation header list.\\n*   **Routing ([router.js](file:///c:/Users/ASUS/Desktop/new%20portfolio/router.js))**: Configured route details and mapped the path `/\n<truncated 7299 bytes>"